{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvafm7LJ8ELBFcvcxMGU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**I'd retire the widget and skip the diary study.**\n\n**Why:**\n- **Few people use it.** Only 1.1% of weekly iOS users have added it, a year after launch.\n- **It doesn't seem to improve retention.** Widget users retain the same as matched users without it. That's the outcome the widget was meant to change.\n- **It costs a lot.** It adds about three days of QA to every release, and keeping it means a five-week rewrite before Apple retires the API. Those weeks could go to work with proven impact.\n\n**Why not the diary study:** It answers a different question: \"what would a good widget look like?\" That's a new feature idea, not grounds to keep this one. It would cost weeks of designer and researcher time and delay a decision that already has a deadline. And whatever it found, a widget redesign would still have to compete with other roadmap items on its merits.\n\n**Quick checks before you commit (days, not weeks):**\n- Do any segments, such as power users or long-streak users, depend heavily on the widget? Look for a retention or engagement difference within a segment.\n- Search reviews and support tickets for mentions of the widget to gauge how loud a removal might be.\n- Confirm the matching method. If widget users were already more engaged, matching should have accounted for that. A null result should still hold up.\n\n**Plan if nothing surprising turns up:**\n1. Decide now, and stop adding widget features.\n2. Remove it in a release well before the API retirement date. Tell widget users in the app and suggest an alternative, like notifications or a Shortcut.\n3. Put the QA days and rewrite time back into the roadmap.\n4. If widgets later look strategically important, start a new, scoped project, possibly with the designer's research, and judge it against other bets."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3192,"cache_read_input_tokens":5037,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3192},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b2628a6-99e6-432a-8440-c6bc8218e1cd","uuid":"79014a6d-59f4-4c9f-a2e6-1b0d69a21988","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:08:36.120Z","request_id":"req_011CfvafkswcyfQ2geU31JSJ"}
